Open-CSMP++ is going to be licensed under L-GPL\&.
.SS "Project status"
CSMP's development is ongoin at a number of international institutions\&. This library is the stable branch of CSMP, supporting a range of applications developed on top of it such as the Australian Carbon Geo-Sequestration Simulator (ACGSS)\&. Another branch is a work in progress, refactoring the finite element and finite volume libraries for massively parallel computations and introducing Eigen's expression templates for matrix algebra into the code, replacing \fBcsmp::DenseMatrix\fP and its associated functionality\&. 
